msgctxt "55\t141"
msgid "Sotenbori, Osaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "205\t344"
msgid ""
"The night before our meeting with Jin Goda,\\nchairman of the Omi "
"Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "370\t600"
msgid "...I had a fateful meeting with a man\\nin Osaka's red light district."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620\t715"
msgid "Hey! There ain't enough bitches!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "730\t800"
msgid "Where the fuck is the manager?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "827\t900"
msgid "No! Don't make eye contact!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912\t990"
msgid "He's a famous yakuza 'round these parts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028\t1225"
msgid ""
"His name was Ryuji Goda, chairman of the\\nGo<Sign:22>Ryu Clan⑬a branch of "
"the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1243\t1366"
msgid "They called him \"The Dragon of Kansai.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1415\t1608"
msgid "I'd say there's only room for one gangster\\ncalled \"the dragon.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1638\t1691"
msgid "Don'tcha agree?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1745\t1769"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr "Certo..."

msgctxt "1788\t1960"
msgid "This must be fate, you and I meetin'.\\nLet me tell ya one more thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1972\t2240"
msgid ""
"Tonight, at the stroke of midnight...\\nThere'll be fireworks in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2262\t2286"
msgid "Fireworks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2558\t2833"
msgid ""
"Just as Ryuji said, that night the Fuma\\nFamily office in Kamurocho was "
"blown up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2860\t2960"
msgid "\"Fireworks...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3102\t3230"
msgid "Ryuji Goda was trying to start a war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3251\t3545"
msgid ""
"He even targeted Jin Goda, who had\\napproved the truce between Tojo and "
"Omi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3590\t3614"
msgid "Ryuji!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3630\t3744"
msgid "So ya want a 50⑬50 peace between us\\nand the Tojo Clan, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3745\t3850"
msgid "Shouldn't it be 80⑬20?\\nOr maybe 90⑬10?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3865\t3980"
msgid "Why are you here?\\nYou're not a part of these negotiations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4055\t4078"
msgid "Do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4175\t4208"
msgid "What are you doing?!"
msgstr "Che vuoi fare?"

msgctxt "4350\t4446"
msgid "So you want a war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4460\t4740"
msgid ""
"Yup. A war between east and west.\\nBut you're forgettin' one more thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4775\t4800"
msgid "Me..."
msgstr "Mah..."

msgctxt "4887\t4980"
msgid "Ryuji Goda was after two things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4993\t5130"
msgid "Gaining complete control of Japan through\\nthe Go<Sign:22>Ryu Clan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5140\t5377"
msgid "...and fighting me, the \"Dragon of Dojima.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5400\t5520"
msgid "To prevent the truce between the Tojo\\nClan and the Omi Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5540\t5693"
msgid ""
"...he was willing to kidnap his own father,\\nthe chairman of the Omi "
"Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5695\t5913"
msgid "Daigo and I went to face off against Ryuji\\nand rescue Jin Goda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5959\t6160"
msgid "But we were stopped by an unexpected visitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6300\t6350"
msgid "Everyone fall out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6362\t6380"
msgid "Yes, ma'am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6575\t6780"
msgid ""
"I'm Kaoru Sayama from Osaka's Division 4.\\nYou're under arrest for assault "
"and battery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6838\t7018"
msgid "That was how I met Kaoru Sayama."
msgstr ""
